                <p><hi rendition="#superscript">1</hi> Weather clear; no storms or surf, except one
                    day when rain fell, causing a larger number of cows to take to the water and
                    making it difficult to distinguish those present from the rocks.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#superscript">2</hi> Rain.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#superscript">3</hi> After July 14 it became impossible, on
                    account of the scattering of the cows, to continue the count for the entire
                    rookery without too great loss of time, and so a section of 18 harems was
                    singled out and the count continued on it.</p>
